<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP RISES TO 405 BPS,312 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP RISES TO 405 BPS,312 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 405 basis points today from 398 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also increased to 312 basis points from 302 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.60%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.55%	405	398 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.42%	418	412 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.48%	312	302 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.26%	334	324 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.18%	342	332 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.15%	245	239 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.29%	331	326 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
